    "section_accordions_Cni8mr": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "text_WntRfm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if I need to cancel or reschedule my training session?",
            "text": "<p>We'll email the calendar invites for your next sessions. We know plans change every now and then, but we kindly ask for cancellations or rescheduling to be made at least 24 hours in advance so we can release the time to other dog parents that need it.  </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_FyFnRD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long are the training sessions?",
            "text": "<p>Every week you'll have 1x 45-minute call with your dedicated trainer and unlimited 15-minute Office Hours to practice your homework with the guidance of a trainer. </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_VprdQ7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I switch trainers?",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely! Our training collective represents some of the best in the country with Fear Free™ certifications from institutions such as The University of Washington Animal Behavior College, Karen Pryor Academy, Cambridge Institute of Canine Behaviour, Training and Brenda Aloff Fundamentals, and more. </p><p>If you'd like to swap your trainer, just let us know and we will arrange that with you. </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_RLLaqR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your training philosophy?",
            "text": "<p>We are proud to stand behind positive-reinforcement training practices, the most powerful tool recognized by PETA, the ASPCA, and the Humane Society of America to transform your pup’s behavior. All of our trainers are force-free certified experts ensuring that the techniques you learn are promoting a positive and healthy relationship between you and your pup. </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Uakjzx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your Training Guarantee?",
            "text": "<p>We couldn't be more committed to your success. Our unique training guarantee gives you the confidence to get started without the risk. If you're not 100% satisfied with Homeschool, you can choose to get your money back OR continue training, on us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_G4Ck8H": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I can't find my training plan.",
            "text": "<p>Your training plan is linked out every week in the group text we set up together. If for any reason, you can't find it just text us and we'll send your custom training plan right over. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
